DTSTAMP:20261001T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270701
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270702
SUMMARY:Saudi Arabia: Next annuity step to 10.5%
DESCRIPTION:Starts in July 2027\; the source does not state the day. Effect
 ive July 2027. The annuity contribution for employees hired after 3 July 2
 024 is scheduled to rise to 10.5% on each side in July 2027.\n\nSource: ht
 tps://www.silberson.com/2025/09/saudi-social-insurance-law-2025/\nDetails:
  https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/saudi-arabia.html#sa-gosi-ann
 uity-2027\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Sources last 
 checked 1 October 2026.
