UID:tn-tn-solidarity-contribution@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261001T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270102
SUMMARY:Tunisia: Social Solidarity Contribution rises to 1%
DESCRIPTION:Starts in January 2027\; the source does not state the day. Eff
 ective January 2027. The 0.5% Social Solidarity Contribution applies throu
 gh fiscal year 2026 and is returns to 1% from January 2027.\n\nSource: htt
 ps://taxsummaries.pwc.com/tunisia/individual/taxes-on-personal-income\nDet
 ails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/tunisia.html#tn-solidari
 ty-contribution\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Sources
  last checked 1 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/tunisia.html#tn-solidarity-
 contribution
