BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pa-pa-insurance@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261001T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270301
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270302
SUMMARY:Panama: Law 462 phases in higher employer social security contribut
 ions through 2029
DESCRIPTION:Phased: 1 Mar 2027 and 1 Mar 2029. Law No. 462\, enacted on 18 
 March 2025\, reforms Panama's social security system. The employer contrib
 ution is 13.25% until 28 February 2027\, rises to 14.25% from 1 March 2027
 \, and to 15.25% from 1 March 2029. The employee contribution remains fixe
 d at 9.75% of gross salary.\n\nSource: https://fmm.com.pa/panama-social-se
 curity-reform-2025-key-highlights-of-law-no-462/\nDetails: https://www.int
 elligentpayroll.eu/countries/panama.html#pa-insurance\n\nFor information o
 nly\, not legal or tax advice. Sources last checked 1 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/panama.html#pa-insurance
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mx-mx-40-hour-week@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261001T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270102
SUMMARY:Mexico: Working week cut from 48 to 40 hours\, 2027-2030
DESCRIPTION:Effective 1 Jan 2027. The reform reduces the maximum working we
 ek gradually: 46 hours in 2027\, 44 in 2028\, 42 in 2029 and 40 in 2030.\n
 \nSource: https://www.gob.mx/stps/documentos/reduccion-de-la-jornada-labor
 al-a-40-horas-preguntas-frecuentes?state=published\nDetails: https://www.i
 ntelligentpayroll.eu/countries/mexico.html#mx-40-hour-week\n\nFor informat
 ion only\, not legal or tax advice. Sources last checked 1 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/mexico.html#mx-40-hour-week
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pe-pe-rmv@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261001T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261001
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261002
SUMMARY:Peru: Minimum wage (RMV) rises to S/ 1\,230\, then S/ 1\,300
DESCRIPTION:Effective 1 Oct 2026. Decreto Supremo Nº 015-2026-TR raises th
 e RMV for private-sector workers from S/ 1\,130.00 to S/ 1\,300.00 in two 
 tranches.\n\nSource: https://busquedas.elperuano.pe/dispositivo/EX/2559163
 -1\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/peru.html#pe-rmv\
 n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Sources last checked 1 
 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/peru.html#pe-rmv
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:switzerland-ch-13th-ahv@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261001T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261202
SUMMARY:Switzerland: First 13th AHV old-age pension paid in December 2026
DESCRIPTION:Starts in December 2026\; the source does not state the day. De
 cember 2026. The 13th AHV pension is paid for the first time in December 2
 026 to around 2.6 million pensioners\, equal to one-twelfth of the old-age
  pensions paid during the year.\n\nSource: https://www.bsv.admin.ch/de/ums
 etzung-13-ahv-rente\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/
 switzerland.html#ch-13th-ahv\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax ad
 vice. Sources last checked 1 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/switzerland.html#ch-13th-ah
 v
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ke-ke-fa2026-return-deadline@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261001T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270102
SUMMARY:Kenya: Individual income tax returns due by end of fourth month
DESCRIPTION:Effective 1 January 2027. From 1 January 2027\, individual taxp
 ayers will be required to file income tax returns by the last day of the f
 ourth month after the end of the year of income.\n\nSource: https://www.kr
 a.go.ke/finance-act-2026-what-it-means-for-you\nDetails: https://www.intel
 ligentpayroll.eu/countries/kenya.html#ke-fa2026-return-deadline\n\nFor inf
 ormation only\, not legal or tax advice. Sources last checked 1 October 20
 26.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/kenya.html#ke-fa2026-return
 -deadline
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
